menu "PlantHub H2 link"

config PLANTHUB_H2_LINK_ENABLED
    bool "Enable the wired H2 Zigbee coordinator link"
    default n
    help
        The two-chip (C6 + H2) appliance transport: a framed UART1 link to a
        dedicated ESP32-H2 Zigbee coordinator. The C6 brain owns the H2 as a
        local radio over this link instead of running its own 802.15.4 stack.
        Set this together with CONFIG_PLANTHUB_ZB_ENABLED=n (the C6 has no
        local Zigbee radio in the two-chip appliance) -- h2_link then backs
        the webserver's local-coordinator permit/status seam.

endmenu
